0153efd-ca23-5fc7-9bdf-30cbb73efaf2" :question/math-academy-id "q-101502" :question/problem "Find the angle between $a=⟨7,2⟩$ and $b=⟨0,6⟩.$ Round your answer to $1$ decimal place." :question/worked-solution "Rearranging the dot product formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7\\cdot 0+2\\cdot 6}{\\sqrt{{7}^{2}+{2}^{2}}\\sqrt{{0}^{2}+{6}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{12}{\\sqrt{53}\\cdot \\sqrt{36}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{53}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{53}})≈{74.1}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-101502/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a087e7bc-4e74-584d-af3b-bf6bee4b75ea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-101502"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-19035"] :question/problem "Find the angle between $a=⟨3,2,1⟩$ and $b=⟨1,2,3⟩.$ Round your answer to the nearest degree." :question/worked-solution "Rearranging the dot product formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 2+1\\cdot 3}{\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{1}^{2}}\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{2}^{2}+{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{\\sqrt{14}\\cdot \\sqrt{14}} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{14} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{7}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{5}{7})≈{44}^{∘}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-67797/selection/1b808f94c51a4b1acd3909d9552d1d5eda9dee41980622a96a5fd400221e793f" :answer/id #uuid "6e5a51c2-